- Request a payment order from the backend
- Start the supported provider checkout flow
- Submit the provider result for verification
- Retrieve the verified payment status
- Display the authoritative result

The trusted backend must:
- Authenticate the requesting user
- Validate the requested amount
- Create payment orders using provider credentials
- Verify payment signatures according to provider documentation
- Validate webhook authenticity
- Process duplicate events idempotently
- Maintain transaction records
- Reconcile payment status
- Enforce authorization
- Record relevant audit events

